73"],"id":"1635888909166211073","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26454,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"看到一辆车，在不让掉头的地方原地掉头，然后技术不好直接撞到电线杆上🤣警察还很好心的把不让掉头的牌子放到他的车旁... https://t.co/aYuIsGf3h9","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1635888909166211073"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-14T16:59:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1635687015609155584"],"id":"1635687015609155584","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":41394,"like_count":36,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"终于想起来把上次去的那个男性专属温泉详细玩法写一下了。完整版全部分享在各个会员平台。 https://t.co/xPUXPBZTY2","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1635687015609155584"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-14T04:48:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1635503218313793537"],"id":"1635503218313793537","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":72852,"like_count":94,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":11},"text":"因为最近AV新法的颁布，对AV业影响很大，导致我身边有大量AV女优朋友想着找人结婚上岸。\n所以想在日本找个AV结婚也并不是太难，问题就在于很多问题你能不能接受了。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1635503218313793537"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-13T12:59:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1635264198501597185"],"id":"1635264198501597185","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":84711,"like_count":58,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":1},"text":"三上引退了啊🙃之前约到的客人算捡着了 https://t.co/nFbEUe5rWg","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1635264198501597185"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-13T02:52:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1635111601501253632"],"id":"1635111601501253632","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":38135,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"今天是M男调教局...现场只要有M男都可以上场被调教...带着一起去的妹子兴奋坏了... https://t.co/P3QQtoCQD3","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1635111601501253632"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-12T06:20:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1634801524261158913"],"id":"1634801524261158913","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":48793,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"公司一日本哥们上班，意外的打扮的十分精致，我就问他今天是不是去相亲，他跟我说他都已经结婚了。\n我说那你这收拾这么精致干啥，还化妆了。\n他说约了个泡泡浴，指名了一个很难指名的妹子。要给人留下好印象。\n我说你不是都结婚了吗?\n然后他教育了我半天结婚应该怎么怎么对老婆好。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1634801524261158913"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-11T01:41:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1634368899348332544"],"id":"1634368899348332544","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":59646,"like_count":36,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"星野はるあ，不得不说真尼玛会玩啊...🙂 https://t.co/UmDn7ZEyLY","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1634368899348332544"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-10T03:17:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1634030720552439811"],"id":"1634030720552439811","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":68399,"like_count":49,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":1},"text":"岁数大了，一晚上两个妹子确实有点吃力...","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1634030720552439811"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-08T10:11:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1633410136470614016"],"id":"1633410136470614016","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":46357,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":1},"text":"这个男性专属温泉，我忍不住又去了... https://t.co/1TqSPjzZzR","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1633410136470614016"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-07T10:09:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1633047312909086720"],"id":"1633047312909086720","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":45133,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"text":"日本为啥便宜的风俗店很少有接待外国人的?最直白的解释就是沟通成本太高。\n越便宜的风俗店，越讲究的就是翻台率。\n\n粉红沙龙，店铺ヘルス这种口活店最便宜的甚至3000日元就能搞20分钟。流浪汉有点钱都能去射一个。店里和女的都是赚钱来的，怎么可能为了赚你那几个钱跟你一个不懂日语的沟通半天。 https://t.co/iTKyUqIKmM","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1633047312909086720"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-07T04:17:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1632958585595629573"],"id":"1632958585595629573","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":35,"impression_count":183482,"like_count":43,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"关于AV女优在风俗店工作，本身这些妹子就是做这行，在风俗店上班是再正常不过的了，AV新法的影响，现役AV进风俗店只是时间早晚得问题。\n预约来说很多店铺对外国人并不友好，打电话过去一听是外国人，就直接跟你说约满了或干脆不接待。最好找个懂日语的朋友帮你约，会员的话可以联系我的客服帮你们约。 https://t.co/El58zgd7nu","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1632958585595629573"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-01T12:38:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1630910309484593153"],"id":"1630910309484593153","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":34209,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今晚要来男公关店上班陪妹子玩...🥲 https://t.co/jGhyhj6ONE","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1630910309484593153"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-03-01T08:01:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1630840758751367168"],"id":"1630840758751367168","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":30553,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"妹子让我帮她把图P的有大片的感觉... https://t.co/pyIaVNctrs","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1630840758751367168"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-02-28T06:21:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1630453009393266688"],"id":"1630453009393266688","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":28144,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"闲没事来喂熊猫... https://t.co/Yq28N9SCqg","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1630453009393266688"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-02-28T04:00:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1630417153232109568","1630417649535709184"],"id":"1630417649535709184","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":38418,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":2},"text":"翻照片时候发现，之前找羽田爱给我当过司机...她是真的能吃...用了两天就养不起了🥲 ht